# Enforce LF line endings for all text files, regardless of local git
# config (core.autocrlf) on any machine that clones/commits to this repo.
# Defensive hygiene: this repo's build-time patch scripts (scripts/apply-*.cjs)
# match literal strings containing bare \n; a CRLF-converted file would
# silently fail those matches. The actual stored blobs were confirmed LF
# already (2026-08-17) -- this just guards against that ever changing.
* text=auto eol=lf
